        "en": "The vast majority of reviewers praise the employees at this West 68th Street store for their welcoming attitude and attentiveness. Shoppers frequently mention team members by name, highlighting associates who helped carry heavy pet food bags to vehicles in the rain and provided knowledgeable advice on pet nutrition. Only an isolated customer reported checkout friction."
