      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents describe this branch as clean, tidy, and easy to navigate when purchasing food, beds, and everyday care supplies for dogs and cats. While a customer noted that the physical footprint limits stock for certain specialty lines, most shoppers find the shelves consistently supplied with healthy pet food formulas and treats."
      }
    },
