        "en": "Feedback regarding pricing is mixed among shoppers. Several customers appreciate loyalty rewards and find everyday cat and dog food reasonably priced. In contrast, other reviewers observe that premium formulas can be somewhat expensive, and one shopper reported an unexpected charge on their receipt for promotional treat items offered at checkout."
